{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FadtES8bHKf4BnFMYBYZdm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-15-1600-fix-batch-round0-revert-and-reapply\n2\t\n3\tRevert the broken batch-round0-descriptors commit (0d1bb2f9) which causes APC 300 STARK proving to hang for 12+ minutes, then re-apply the batch Round 0 path with the CPU bottleneck fixed. The existing batch code redundantly reconstructs logup interaction DAGs and rules per batchable AIR via `build_logup_rules_for_air()` (involving `SymbolicDagBuilder`, `SymbolicRulesGpu::new`, and per-AIR device uploads), which takes prohibitively long for the ~300 small AIRs at APC 300. The fix reuses the precomputed `logup_round0_buffer_size` from `AirDataGpu` and the existing per-AIR logup rule data (DAG, rules, weights) that the non-batched path already constructs during Phase 1 work-item preparation, avoiding all redundant CPU-side symbolic computation.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"418559aa-595d-46f9-bff0-353258f08904","uuid":"ea7882d7-ad11-46be-8848-b8c661b88e2f","timestamp":"2026-04-15T15:00:35.391Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-15-1600-fix-batch-round0-revert-and-reapply\n\nRevert the broken batch-round0-descriptors commit (0d1bb2f9) which causes APC 300 STARK proving to hang for 12+ minutes, then re-apply the batch Round 0 path with the CPU bottleneck fixed. The existing batch code redundantly reconstructs logup interaction DAGs and rules per batchable AIR via `build_logup_rules_for_air()` (involving `SymbolicDagBuilder`, `SymbolicRulesGpu::new`, and per-AIR device uploads), which takes prohibitively long for the ~300 small AIRs at APC 300. The fix reuses the precomputed `logup_round0_buffer_size` from `AirDataGpu` and the existing per-AIR logup rule data (DAG, rules, weights) that the non-batched path already constructs during Phase 1 work-item preparation, avoiding all redundant CPU-side symbolic computation.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
